    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115685" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῐά</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρά, γελοίασμα,
				παίγνια</span>
			, Hsch: hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῐάζω</span></b> , 
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψιάδδω</span></b> , <i>play, sport,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὶ δὴ παρ᾽ Εὐρώταν ψιάδδοντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					1302
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψιάδδειν: παίζειν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (Prob. shortd. forms of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑψία,
				ἑψιάομαι,</span> qq. v.)</div>
